      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you, but it's probably not *that* serious right? my sister had a similar thing after her surgery and she just rested for a few days and it went away fine. i'm just so tired of doctors telling me everything is an emergency. if i just stay home, keep the pain managed with meds, and keep an eye on the fever, i'll be okay, right? i really just want to avoid the ER unless it gets way worse.",
